Dialogue: 2,1:31:54.65,1:32:04.91,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}How much farther will you walk?
Dialogue: 2,1:32:04.91,1:32:14.35,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)}The wind calls out, and you come to a halt
Dialogue: 2,1:32:25.49,1:32:35.96,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}The first beat made a resounding thump
Dialogue: 2,1:32:35.96,1:32:45.83,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,as a single life began
Dialogue: 2,1:32:45.83,1:32:51.06,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,Before long, you unfurled your little hands
Dialogue: 2,1:32:51.06,1:32:56.22,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,in search of something unknown
Dialogue: 2,1:32:56.22,1:33:01.38,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,Before long, you discovered
Dialogue: 2,1:33:01.38,1:33:08.32,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,900)}another besides yourself
Dialogue: 2,1:33:12.11,1:33:22.46,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}Though you've added more candles to celebrate your birth,
Dialogue: 2,1:33:22.46,1:33:32.25,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,and you've left your one and only hometown behind,
Dialogue: 2,1:33:32.25,1:33:37.50,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,still, you seek the unknown,
Dialogue: 2,1:33:37.50,1:33:42.76,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,your wide-eyed gaze shines bright
Dialogue: 2,1:33:42.76,1:33:47.85,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,Contained within your pockets
Dialogue: 2,1:33:47.85,1:33:54.35,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,lie memories you share with someone else...
Dialogue: 2,1:33:54.35,1:33:59.58,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,Innumerable meetings
Dialogue: 2,1:33:59.58,1:34:04.65,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,Innumerable farewells
Dialogue: 2,1:34:04.65,1:34:15.21,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,900)}And precious few dreamlike moments
Dialogue: 2,1:34:16.74,1:34:27.08,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}How much farther will you walk?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:27.08,1:34:37.44,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,The wind calls out, and you gaze toward the sky
Dialogue: 2,1:34:37.44,1:34:47.49,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,How much farther will we walk together?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:47.49,1:34:58.08,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}Together with the wind, we will set out once again
Dialogue: 2,1:34:58.08,1:35:08.29,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}Stepping out onto the road, let us go on and on
Dialogue: 2,1:35:08.29,1:35:18.69,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,Until we seize that sought after dream
Dialogue: 2,1:35:18.69,1:35:28.91,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,Stepping out onto the road, let us go on and on
Dialogue: 2,1:35:28.91,1:35:39.04,Song TL,Kaze to Issho ni TL,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}Until we seize that sought after dream
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
