Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:34.47,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,Be it fire, water, grass, or forests,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:38.43,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,the ground, the clouds, or under that girl's skirt (Eek!)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:42.22,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,It's really, really, really, really hard to handle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:50.39,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,but I'm gonna get them all! I'm gonna get Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:53.70,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,Masara Town, I bid you goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:58.10,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,I'm going on a journey with this little guy (Pikachu!)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:02.15,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,I'll win each battle with the moves I've mastered,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:05.92,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,then head to the next town and make friends along the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:09.91,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,There's no way to know for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:13.86,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,if things will always work out (Got that right!)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:23.21,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,But with my companions by my side, we'll live life to the fullest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.99,0:16:32.31,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,Be it fire, water, grass, or forests,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.31,0:16:36.29,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,the ground, the clouds, or under that girl's skirt (Knock it off!)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:39.60,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,It's really, really, really, really hard to handle,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:48.28,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,but I'm gonna get them all! I'm gonna get Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:51.44,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,Weary from battling, I bid you goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:55.96,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,When I close my eyes, I'm taken back (Pikachu?)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:59.91,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,to the roaring fire, the dancing wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:03.46,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,and the echoing shouts of that battle
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:07.74,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,"Yesterday's foe is today's ally"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:11.65,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,According to some old saying (What do you mean "Old"?!)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:22.02,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,But an ally made today is my friend tomorrow, and will be forevermore
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:33.00,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,Ah, I want to be a Pokémon Master so bad
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:43.15,Song TL,Mezase Pokémon Master TL,0,0,0,,I wanna be one! Gotta be one! Will be one!
Comment: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:35.89,Main,,0,0,0,,
